<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 18.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 18.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 July 18		July 17</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.156		  5.131</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  20.150		 19.307</p>
<p>Cash balance		  25.306		 24.438</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,277.382	     5,277.127</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $430 million were issued and $152 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
